cmd-mappinglavaland-desc = Loads Lavaland on a new map. Warning: this can temporarily freeze the server!
cmd-mappinglavaland-help = mappinglavaland <prototype id> [seed (0-65535)]
cmd-mappinglavaland-missing-prototype = Enter a Lavaland map prototype ID as the first argument.
cmd-mappinglavaland-invalid-prototype = No Lavaland map prototype exists with ID "{$prototype}".
cmd-mappinglavaland-invalid-seed = Invalid seed "{$seed}". Enter a whole number from 0 to 65535.
cmd-mappinglavaland-load-failed = Failed to load Lavaland! Ensure that the lavaland.enabled CVar is set to true and check the server logs.
cmd-mappinglavaland-success = Successfully created a new Lavaland map: {$map}
